      "description": "Three camels are prominently featured in the image, standing side by side with their heads tilted upward and mouths open as if shouting or roaring. They are the central visual focus and are positioned against a backdrop of a blue sky with scattered white clouds. Their posture and open mouths contribute to the meme's humorous yet inflammatory tone.",
