      "instance_name": "hateful_anger",
      "label": "hateful anger expressed through inflammatory text and visual symbolism",
      "description": "The emotion is conveyed through the aggressive, shouting posture of the camels and the hateful, inflammatory text overlay that equates all members of a group (implied to be Middle Eastern or Muslim) with terrorism. This creates a tone of anger and hostility directed at a specific group, using visual and textual elements to provoke fear and reinforce prejudice.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
