      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme equates all camels (symbolizing Middle Easterners or Muslims) with terrorism, which is a direct attack on a protected group based on ethnicity and religion. This is a clear example of Islamophobia and hate speech.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
